# the page pictures (screenshots to look at): every page, with values that show something.
# Pages: 0 Play 1 1 Play 2 2 Tone 1 3 Tone 2 4 Osc 5 LFO depths 6 LFO mods 7 Partner 8 Setup 1 9 Setup 2 10 Swell 11 Effects 1
# 12 Effects 2.
tap PLAY
wait 1500
shot play.png
# Play 2: drone I resonant, drone II quieter
tap HOME
expect view 1
spin K1 50
spin K4 -30
wait 300
shot play2.png
# Tone: drone I driven and on a narrow square, drone II as it starts
tap EDIT
expect view 4
spin K1 15
tap ENV
expect view 2
spin K1 40
spin K2 50
tap HOME
tap ENV
wait 2500
shot tone.png
# Tone 2: drone I a little pink noise under its tones, drone II white noise at the top (then both back to none)
tap ENV
expect view 3
spin K1 30
spin K3 100
spin K4 -1
wait 1500
shot tone2.png
spin K1 -30
spin K3 -100
# Osc: drone I between saw and square with some sub, drone II on triangle
tap EDIT
expect view 4
spin K2 25
spin K3 -100
spin K3 33
wait 300
shot osc.png
# LFO: Wave I a triangle, Wave II an exp saw; some depth on each drone's filter
tap LFO
expect view 5
spin PRESET -10
spin PRESET 1
spin ALGO -10
spin ALGO 3
spin SELECT -20
spin K2 30
spin K4 -20
tapkey b0
tapkey b8
tapkey b8
tapkey b3
tapkey b3
wait 2500
shot lfo.png
# LFO mods: the rate mod, cross-mod's amount, the delay LFO's depth
tap LFO
expect view 6
spin K1 40
spin K3 20
spin K4 50
wait 300
shot lfo2.png
# Partner: drone I detuned (beating), drone II an octave up and a fifth
tap SEQ
expect view 7
spin K2 40
spin K3 3
wait 300
shot partner.png
# Setup: some glide, drift and stereo
tap GLO
expect view 8
spin K1 30
spin K3 50
wait 300
shot setup.png
# Setup 2: Morph, Tune, Scene switch
tap GLO
expect view 9
spin K3 20
wait 300
shot setup2.png
# Pulse (hold ARP for its page; a tap starts it): some swing
tap ARP
expect par55 1
press ARP
expect view 10
spin K4 30
wait 2500
shot pulse.png
release ARP
# Effects: echoes and the hall
tap FX
expect view 11
spin K2 30
spin K3 40
spin K4 20
wait 300
shot fx.png
# Effects 2: the reverb's type and tail
tap FX
expect view 12
wait 300
shot fx2.png
